'''Ancient Egg: N106''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 30 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]]. [[True Form]] grants Behemoth Slayer, Wave Immunity, increased cost, and improved overall stats.

